      "summary": [
        "WP-005 implementation verified complete. The api-knowledge.ts file already correctly implements the full repository-scope model as required: KnowledgeUpdateBodySchema uses InsightScope enum (['global','repository']) with repository_name field; KnowledgeMoveBodySchema is redesigned with source_scope/source_repository_name/repository_name and .strict(); KnowledgeListParams uses repository_name; all five handlers (handleListKnowledge, handleDeleteKnowledge, handlePromoteKnowledge, handleMoveKnowledge, handleUpdateKnowledge) operate on repository scope correctly.",
